<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,300;1,9..144,400&family=Mulish:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">[{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Article", "headline": "The cost of group health insurance for companies in India", "description": "Half of Indian companies spend ₹6,000–24,000 per employee a year on group health insurance. See costs by company size, what moves premiums, and how to budget.", "url": "https://www.plumhq.com/group-health-insurance-cost", "mainEntityOfPage": "https://www.plumhq.com/group-health-insurance-cost", "author": {"@type": "Person", "name": "Akshay Golechha", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/akshaygolechha/"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Plum", "url": "https://www.plumhq.com"}, "dateModified": "2026-10-14", "inLanguage": "en-IN"}, {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does group health insurance cost per employee in India?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Across 3,500+ companies insured through Plum, half spend roughly ₹6,000 to ₹24,000 per employee per year. Where a company lands depends on sum insured, family definition, age mix, industry, and add-ons. A baseline ₹3 lakh sum insured policy with E+S+C family definition for a mid-size tech company usually prices between ₹4,500 and ₹8,500 PEPY."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is group health insurance cheaper than individual health insurance?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Group health insurance in India is typically 30 to 60 percent cheaper per rupee of cover than an equivalent individual retail health insurance policy, because insurers price group policies on pooled risk and because group policies have lower acquisition costs. Group policies also usually waive waiting periods and cover pre-existing conditions from day one, which retail policies do not."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the minimum group size for group health insurance in India?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The IRDAI defines a group as any legally formed association of 7 or more members. Plum writes GHI policies starting at a minimum group size of 7 employees. Some insurers set higher minimums (10, 15, or 20 employees); others match the regulatory floor."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do group health insurance premiums increase every year?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Usually yes. Renewal pricing is driven by actual claims experience in the prior year, plus a market-wide medical inflation factor of 10 to 15 percent per year. A policy with a loss ratio below 60 percent might see a 5 to 15 percent renewal increase. A policy with a loss ratio above 85 percent can see renewal increases of 25 to 45 percent or more."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is GST applicable on group health insurance premiums?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. GST on group health insurance premium is currently charged at 18 percent, and the GST portion is in addition to the premium amount. For a ₹10 lakh annual premium, the total invoice is ₹11.8 lakh including GST."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is group health insurance tax deductible for the employer?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Premium paid by the employer for employee group health insurance is deductible as a business expense under the Income Tax Act. GST paid on the premium is available as input tax credit for companies registered under GST, subject to the applicable rules."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can employees pay for group health insurance themselves?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, through voluntary top-ups and dependent buy-ups structured as salary-deducted contributions. Employee-paid premium for self and family may qualify for Section 80D deduction under personal income tax, subject to the usual limits."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What happens if an employee leaves the company mid-year?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The leaving employee's cover ends on the last working day (or on the policy exit date the employer defines). Some policies offer portability to an individual retail policy on exit, which the employee pays for. The employer typically does not receive a pro-rated refund."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How is group health insurance different from ESIC?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "ESIC is a statutory scheme for employees earning up to ₹21,000 per month, funded by employer and employee contributions, with access to ESIC-affiliated hospitals and dispensaries. Group health insurance is a private policy with broader hospital network choice and typically richer benefits. Many companies run both: ESIC for the covered segment and private GHI for the rest, or private GHI on top of ESIC for all employees."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I include parents in group health insurance?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Parental cover is an add-on that most insurers support, structured as a floater or individual sum insured for one or both parents (or parents-in-law). Parental cover typically adds 40 to 120 percent to base premium depending on parent age bands and sum insured."}}]}]</script>
<style is:global>

/* ── PLUM DESIGN SYSTEM – REAL FONTS + TOKENS ────────────────────────
   GT Alpina (serif display) + Passenger Sans (humanist sans)
   Tokens: plum-design.md
   ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

@font-face {
  font-family: 'GT Alpina';
  src: url('/fonts/GT-Alpina-Standard-Regular.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'GT Alpina';
  src: url('/fonts/GT-Alpina-Standard-Light-Italic.woff2') format('woff2'), url('/fonts/GT-Alpina-Standard-Light-Italic.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 300;
  font-style: italic;
  font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Passenger Sans';
  src: url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Regular.woff2') format('woff2'), url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Regular.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Passenger Sans';
  src: url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Medium.woff2') format('woff2'), url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Medium.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 500;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Passenger Sans';
  src: url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Semibold.woff2') format('woff2'), url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Semibold.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Passenger Sans';
  src: url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Black.woff2') format('woff2'), url('/fonts/PassengerSans-Black.woff') format('woff');
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

/* ── TOKENS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
:root {
  /* Surfaces */
  --cream:          #FFFAF2;
  --cream-deep:     #F5EEE0;
  --cream-warm:     #EDE3D0;

  /* Brand red */
  --plum-red:       #FF4052;
  --plum-red-deep:  #D9283A;
  --plum-red-press: #B8202F;

  /* Severity scale */
  --sev-blush:      #FFE7EA;
  --sev-pink:       #FFD9DC;
  --sev-coral:      #FF9FA8;

  /* Foreground */
  --fg-1:           #3A0E2B;
  --fg-2:           #6B3A58;
  --fg-muted:       #9B7A8A;
  --fg-on-red:      #FFFAF2;

  /* Rules */
  --line-lav:       #C7B1C0;
  --line-lav-2:     #DDD0D8;

  /* Legacy aliases used throughout content (map to system) */
  --ink:            var(--fg-1);
  --ink-mid:        var(--fg-2);
  --ink-muted:      var(--fg-muted);
  --surface:        var(--cream);
  --white:          #FFFAF2;
  --rule:           var(--line-lav-2);

  /* Accent colours – mapped to severity scale for data components */
  --accent-teal:         #0F6E56;
  --accent-teal-light:   #E6F5EF;
  --accent-teal-mid:     #1D9E75;
  --accent-coral:        var(--plum-red);
  --accent-coral-light:  var(--sev-blush);
  --accent-blue:         #185FA5;
  --accent-blue-light:   #E6F1FB;
  --accent-amber:        #BA7517;
  --accent-amber-light:  #FAEEDA;
  --accent-purple:       #534AB7;
  --accent-purple-light: #EEEDFE;
  --mandatory-border:    var(--plum-red);
  --recommended-bg:      #E6F5EF;

  /* Typography */
  --font-display:   'GT Alpina', Georgia, serif;
  --font-sans:      'Passenger Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;

  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-cta:     0 4px 24px rgba(58,14,43,.10);
  --shadow-hover:   0 8px 32px rgba(58,14,43,.13);

  /* Radius */
  --r-card:         7px;
}

/* ── RESET ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.72;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  background: var(--cream);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

/* ── CTA BUTTON ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.nav-cta {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
  background: var(--plum-red);
  padding: 8px 20px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  text-decoration: none;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-cta);
  transition: background .15s ease-out;
  letter-spacing: .01em;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--plum-red-deep); }
.nav-cta:active { background: var(--plum-red-press); }

/* ── SECTION NAV (sticky TOC) ────────────────────────────────────────── */
.toc-bar {
  background: var(--cream);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  padding: 0 clamp(20px,5vw,64px);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  overflow-x: auto;
}
.toc-bar ul {
  display: flex;
  list-style: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.toc-bar a {
  display: block;
  padding: 14px 14px;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: .03em;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: color .15s, border-color .15s;
}
.toc-bar a:hover { color: var(--fg-1); border-bottom-color: var(--plum-red); }

/* ── HERO – full-bleed red ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
.masthead {
  background: var(--plum-red);
  padding: clamp(48px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,5vw,64px) clamp(48px,6vw,72px);
}
.masthead-inner { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }

.masthead-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
  opacity: .7;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}
.masthead-eyebrow-rule {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 28px; height: 1px;
  background: var(--fg-on-red);
  opacity: .5;
}

.masthead h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 62px);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.08;
  letter-spacing: -.03em;
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.masthead h1 em {
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 300;
}

.masthead-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: clamp(14px,1.8vw,16px);
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
  opacity: .72;
  max-width: 560px;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.masthead-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,250,242,.2);
}
.masthead-meta span {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
  opacity: .55;
  background: rgba(255,250,242,.08);
  border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,250,242,.2);
  padding: 4px 10px;
}
/* Remove old pseudo-element dot */
.masthead-meta span::before { display: none; }

/* ── ARROW-TIPPED RULE ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.rule-section {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 64px 0 0;
  user-select: none;
}
.rule-line { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--plum-red); }
.rule-arr-l { width:0; height:0; border-top:4px solid transparent; border-bottom:4px solid transparent; border-right:6px solid var(--plum-red); }
.rule-arr-r { width:0; height:0; border-top:4px solid transparent; border-bottom:4px solid transparent; border-left:6px solid var(--plum-red); }

/* ── LAYOUT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.page-body {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 clamp(20px,5vw,64px) 80px;
}

/* ── SECTION HEADER ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
section { margin-bottom: 0; }

.section-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--plum-red);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.section-label span { display: none; } /* remove old teal line */

section { padding-top: 48px; }

h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 36px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.04em;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.section-intro {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--fg-2);
  max-width: 620px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

/* ── INTRO STRIP CARDS ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.intro-strip {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.intro-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 16px 18px;
  transition: background .15s;
}
.intro-card:hover { background: var(--cream-deep); }
.intro-card-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.intro-card-value {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  line-height: 1.45;
}

/* ── LEGEND ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.legend { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legend-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-muted);
}
.legend-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; }

/* ── CALLOUTS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.callout {
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  padding: 16px 20px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.callout-icon { font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
.callout strong { font-weight: 600; }

.callout-teal  { background: var(--accent-teal-light); border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-teal); color: #084F3C; }
.callout-amber { background: var(--accent-amber-light); border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-amber); color: #633806; }
.callout-coral { background: var(--sev-blush); border-left: 2px solid var(--plum-red); color: #8B1C26; }
.callout-blue  { background: var(--accent-blue-light); border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-blue); color: #0D3A6A; }

/* ── POLICY CARDS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.policy-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: box-shadow .2s;
}
.policy-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }

.policy-card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 18px 20px 14px;
}
.policy-icon {
  width: 36px; height: 36px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 0; /* hide emoji */
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
}
.policy-icon.teal   { background: var(--accent-teal-light); }
.policy-icon.coral  { background: var(--sev-blush); }
.policy-icon.blue   { background: var(--accent-blue-light); }
.policy-icon.amber  { background: var(--accent-amber-light); }
.policy-icon.purple { background: var(--accent-purple-light); }

/* Replace emoji with coloured dot */
.policy-icon::after {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  width: 10px; height: 10px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--plum-red);
}

.policy-title-block { flex: 1; }
.policy-name {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.policy-tagline {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
}

.policy-badges { display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }

/* Severity chips – uppercase sans, 0.5px red border, no rounding */
.badge {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 0;
}
.badge-mandatory   { background: var(--sev-blush);  color: var(--plum-red);   border: 0.5px solid var(--plum-red); }
.badge-recommended { background: var(--accent-teal-light); color: var(--accent-teal); border: 0.5px solid var(--accent-teal); }
.badge-sector      { background: var(--accent-purple-light); color: var(--accent-purple); border: 0.5px solid var(--accent-purple); }
.badge-gc          { background: var(--accent-blue-light); color: var(--accent-blue); border: 0.5px solid var(--accent-blue); }

.policy-body {
  padding: 0 20px 18px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}
.policy-field label {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.policy-field p {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--fg-1); line-height: 1.6;
}
.policy-field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.policy-divider { margin: 0 20px 14px; height: 0.5px; background: var(--line-lav); }

.trigger-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  background: var(--cream-deep);
  border: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
  padding: 2px 8px;
  margin: 2px 2px 2px 0;
  color: var(--fg-2);
}

/* ── TABLES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
/* shared table base */
.statutory-table,
.data-table,
.bench-table,
.city-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* dark aubergine headers */
.statutory-table thead th,
.city-table thead th {
  background: var(--fg-1);
  color: rgba(255,250,242,.72);
  padding: 10px 13px;
  text-align: left;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.statutory-table td,
.city-table td {
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  color: var(--fg-1);
  vertical-align: top;
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.statutory-table tr:last-child td,
.city-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.statutory-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--cream-deep); }
.city-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(--cream-deep); }

.dot-mandatory   { color: var(--plum-red); font-weight: 600; }
.dot-recommended { color: var(--accent-teal); font-weight: 600; }

/* data-table (global benchmark) */
.data-table th {
  padding: 10px 13px;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
}
.data-table th.col-dim   { background: var(--cream-deep); color: var(--fg-muted); }
.data-table th.col-india { background: var(--fg-1); color: rgba(255,250,242,.72); }
.data-table th.col-global{ background: var(--accent-teal); color: #fff; }
.data-table td {
  padding: 12px 14px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  color: var(--fg-1); vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px;
}
.data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.data-table td.col-india  { background: var(--cream-deep); }
.data-table td.col-global { background: var(--accent-teal-light); font-weight: 500; color: #084F3C; }

/* bench-table */
.bench-table th {
  padding: 11px 13px;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
}
.bench-table th:first-child { background: var(--cream-deep); color: var(--fg-muted); width: 22%; }
.bench-table th.b1 { background: #EBF4FF; color: var(--accent-blue); }
.bench-table th.b2 { background: var(--accent-teal-light); color: var(--accent-teal); }
.bench-table th.b3 { background: var(--accent-amber-light); color: var(--accent-amber); }
.bench-table th.b4 { background: var(--accent-purple-light); color: var(--accent-purple); }
.bench-table td {
  padding: 11px 13px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  color: var(--fg-1); vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.bench-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.bench-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-2); background: var(--cream-deep); }

/* city bar */
.city-bar {
  display: inline-block; height: 6px;
  background: var(--plum-red); opacity: .55;
  border-radius: 1px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;
}

/* ── CLAIMS CARDS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.claims-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px;
}
.claims-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  padding: 16px 18px;
}
.claims-card h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.claims-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2); font-size: 14px;
}
.claims-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.claims-label { flex: 1; color: var(--fg-2); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
.claims-pct { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-1); min-width: 34px; text-align: right; }
.claims-amt { font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); min-width: 68px; text-align: right; }
.claims-bar-wrap { width: 56px; height: 5px; background: var(--line-lav-2); flex-shrink: 0; }
.claims-bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--plum-red); opacity: .65; }

/* ── STAT ROW ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.stat-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.stat-box {
  background: var(--cream-warm);
  padding: 18px 14px;
  text-align: center;
}
.stat-num {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(26px,3.5vw,34px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.03em;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.stat-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ── CHECKLIST GRID ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.checklist-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.checklist-block {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 18px 20px;
}
.checklist-block h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--fg-1); margin-bottom: 12px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
}
.phase-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
.phase-dot.p1 { background: var(--plum-red); }
.phase-dot.p2 { background: var(--accent-teal); }
.phase-dot.p3 { background: var(--accent-blue); }
.checklist-block ul { list-style: none; }
.checklist-block li {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2);
  padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 7px; line-height: 1.55;
}
.checklist-block li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.checklist-block li::before {
  content: '–';
  font-size: 10px; color: var(--plum-red); flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* ── PULL QUOTE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.pull-quote {
  border-left: 2px solid var(--plum-red);
  padding: 16px 20px;
  margin: 28px 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2.6vw, 26px);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  line-height: 1.45;
  background: var(--cream-deep);
  border-radius: 0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0;
}

/* ── PERSONA STRIP ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.persona-strip {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 24px 0;
}
.persona-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 18px 18px 16px;
}
.persona-card::before { display: none; }
.persona-emoji { display: none; } /* no emoji per design spec */
.persona-name {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--fg-1); margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.persona-role {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;
  font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .03em;
}
.persona-needs { list-style: none; }
.persona-needs li {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2);
  padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: baseline; line-height: 1.55;
}
.persona-needs li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.persona-needs li::before { content: '–'; font-size: 10px; color: var(--plum-red); flex-shrink: 0; }

/* ── BENEFIT DIMENSION CARDS ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
.benefit-dimension {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: box-shadow .2s;
}
.benefit-dimension:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }

.bd-head {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr auto;
  gap: 14px;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 16px 20px 14px;
}
.bd-icon {
  width: 36px; height: 36px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 0; /* suppress emoji */
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.bd-icon::after {
  content: '';
  display: block; width: 10px; height: 10px;
  border-radius: 50%; background: var(--plum-red);
}
.bd-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--fg-1);
}
.bd-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;
}
.bd-plum-badge {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  background: var(--sev-blush);
  color: var(--plum-red);
  border: 0.5px solid var(--plum-red);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border-radius: 0;
}
.bd-body {
  border-top: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
  padding: 16px 20px 18px;
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;
}
.bd-col h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.bd-stat-row {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;
  padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2); font-size: 13px;
}
.bd-stat-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.bd-stat-num {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 28px; color: var(--fg-1); line-height: 1; flex-shrink: 0;
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
}
.bd-stat-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.5;
}
.bd-check-list { list-style: none; }
.bd-check-list li {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--fg-2);
  padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: baseline; line-height: 1.55;
}
.bd-check-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.bd-check-list li::before { content: '–'; font-size: 10px; color: var(--plum-red); flex-shrink: 0; }
.bd-check-list li.checked::before { content: '+'; color: var(--accent-teal); font-weight: 700; }

/* adoption bar */
.adoption-bar-wrap { background: var(--line-lav-2); height: 6px; margin: 5px 0 2px; }
.adoption-bar { height: 100%; background: var(--plum-red); opacity: .7; }
.adoption-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); }

/* ── OUTSIDE-LANE BLOCK ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.outside-lane {
  background: var(--fg-1);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  padding: 24px 26px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
.outside-lane h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.02em;
  color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.outside-lane > p {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,250,242,.5);
  line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.outside-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}
.outside-item {
  background: rgba(255,250,242,.04);
  border: none;
  padding: 14px 16px;
}
.outside-item-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,250,242,.4); margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.outside-item-value {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,250,242,.72); line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.page-footer {
  background: var(--fg-1);
  padding: 32px clamp(20px,5vw,64px);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 32px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 64px;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--plum-red);
}
.footer-logo img { height: 24px; width: auto; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; filter: brightness(0) invert(1); opacity: .8; }
.footer-brand {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400;
  color: rgba(255,250,242,.5);
  margin-bottom: 4px; letter-spacing: -.01em;
}
.page-footer > div:first-child > div:not(.footer-brand) {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,250,242,.35); line-height: 1.65;
}
.page-footer > div:last-child {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,250,242,.3);
  line-height: 1.6; max-width: 420px; text-align: right;
}

/* ── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .policy-body, .claims-grid, .bd-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .policy-badges { justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 6px; }
  .policy-card-head { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .bench-table { font-size: 11.5px; }
  .bench-table th, .bench-table td { padding: 8px; }
  .outside-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .page-footer > div:last-child { text-align: left; }
  .persona-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .checklist-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .intro-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { transition: none !important; }
}

/* ── MOBILE: table scroll wrappers ─────────────────────────────────── */
.table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.table-scroll .statutory-table,
.table-scroll .data-table,
.table-scroll .bench-table,
.table-scroll .city-table { min-width: 560px; }

/* improved mobile responsive rules */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .masthead { padding: 40px 20px 36px; }
  .page-body { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
  .toc-bar { padding: 0 16px; }
  .policy-body, .claims-grid, .bd-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .policy-card-head { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .policy-badges { justify-content: flex-start; margin-top: 8px; }
  .bench-table, .bench-table th, .bench-table td { font-size: 13px; }
  .bench-table th, .bench-table td { padding: 9px 10px; }
  .outside-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .page-footer { flex-direction: column; padding: 28px 20px; }
  .page-footer > div:last-child { text-align: left; }
  .persona-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .checklist-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .intro-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(22px, 6vw, 30px) !important; }
  .rule-section { margin: 40px 0 0; }
  .claims-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .section-label { font-size: 11px; }
}


/* ── DEEP-DIVE ACCORDION SECTIONS ───────────────────────────────────── */

/* Section accordion – distinct from the existing broker questions accordion */
.deep-accordion {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.deep-accordion details {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  background: var(--cream);
}
.deep-accordion details:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.deep-accordion details[open] { background: var(--cream-deep); }

.deep-accordion summary {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  cursor: pointer;
  list-style: none;
  gap: 16px;
  transition: color .15s;
}
.deep-accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.deep-accordion summary:hover { color: var(--plum-red); }

.acc-summary-inner { flex: 1; }
.acc-summary-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--plum-red);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.acc-summary-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 22px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  line-height: 1.25;
}
.acc-summary-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
  margin-top: 3px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.deep-acc-indicator {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 28px; height: 28px;
  border: 1px solid var(--plum-red);
  color: var(--plum-red);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 300;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  transition: transform .2s ease-out, background .15s;
  border-radius: 0;
  line-height: 1;
}
.deep-accordion details[open] .deep-acc-indicator {
  transform: rotate(45deg);
  background: var(--plum-red);
  color: var(--fg-on-red);
}

.deep-acc-body {
  padding: 24px 24px 28px;
  border-top: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
}

/* Body prose inside deep accordion */
.deep-acc-body p {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--fg-2);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  max-width: 680px;
}
.deep-acc-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.deep-acc-body p strong { color: var(--fg-1); font-weight: 600; }

/* Two-column grid inside accordion body */
.acc-grid-2 {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.acc-grid-cell {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 18px 20px;
}
.acc-grid-cell h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.acc-grid-cell p {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
}

/* Tax table inside accordion */
.tax-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.tax-table thead th {
  padding: 10px 14px;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav);
}
.tax-table thead th:first-child { background: var(--cream-deep); color: var(--fg-muted); width: 24%; }
.tax-table thead th.th-employer { background: var(--fg-1); color: rgba(255,250,242,.75); }
.tax-table thead th.th-old { background: var(--accent-amber-light); color: var(--accent-amber); }
.tax-table thead th.th-new { background: var(--sev-blush); color: var(--plum-red); }
.tax-table tbody td {
  padding: 11px 14px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  color: var(--fg-1);
  vertical-align: top;
  line-height: 1.55;
  font-size: 13.5px;
}
.tax-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.tax-table tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; background: var(--cream-deep); color: var(--fg-2); }
.tax-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td:not(:first-child) { background: rgba(255,250,242,.6); }
.tax-exempt { color: var(--accent-teal); font-weight: 600; }
.tax-taxable { color: var(--plum-red); font-weight: 600; }
.tax-partial { color: var(--accent-amber); font-weight: 600; }

/* Regime callout */
.regime-split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 16px 0 20px;
}
.regime-card { padding: 18px 20px; }
.regime-card.old { background: var(--accent-amber-light); }
.regime-card.new { background: var(--sev-blush); }
.regime-label {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .09em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.regime-card.old .regime-label { color: var(--accent-amber); }
.regime-card.new .regime-label { color: var(--plum-red); }
.regime-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 0 !important;
}
.regime-card.old p { color: #5C3A00; }
.regime-card.new p { color: #7A1020; }

/* Leave table */
.leave-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.leave-table thead th {
  background: var(--fg-1);
  color: rgba(255,250,242,.75);
  padding: 10px 14px;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.leave-table tbody td {
  padding: 11px 14px;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  color: var(--fg-1);
  vertical-align: top;
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.leave-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.leave-table tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-2); background: var(--cream-deep); width: 22%; }
.leave-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td:not(:first-child) { background: var(--cream-deep); }

/* Allowance cards */
.allowance-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--line-lav);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-lav);
  border-radius: var(--r-card);
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.allowance-card { background: var(--cream); padding: 18px 18px 16px; }
.allowance-card:hover { background: var(--cream-deep); }
.allowance-name {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -.01em;
  color: var(--fg-1);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.allowance-abbr {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--plum-red);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.allowance-rows { list-style: none; }
.allowance-rows li {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--fg-2);
  padding: 5px 0;
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);
  line-height: 1.45;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1px;
}
.allowance-rows li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.allowance-rows .row-key {
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-muted);
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .acc-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .regime-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .allowance-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .tax-table { font-size: 12px; }
  .tax-table th, .tax-table td { padding: 9px 10px; }
  .deep-acc-body p { font-size: 14px; }
}


:root{--font-display:'GT Alpina','Fraunces',Georgia,serif;--font-sans:'Passenger Sans','Mulish',system-ui,sans-serif}

.dist-card,.peer-card,.cmp-card{margin:1.8rem 0;background:var(--cream-deep);border-radius:7px;padding:clamp(18px,3vw,32px)}
.dist-card figcaption,.cmp-card figcaption{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted);margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.dist{margin:.2rem 0 .9rem}
.dist-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted);margin-bottom:.4rem}
.dist-bar{display:flex;height:44px;gap:2px}
.dist-ref .dist-bar{height:12px}
.dist-ref .seg span{display:none}
.seg{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 0.5px var(--plum-red)}
.seg span{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.s0{background:var(--sev-blush);color:var(--fg-1)} .s1{background:var(--sev-pink);color:var(--fg-1)} .s2{background:var(--sev-coral);color:var(--fg-1)}
.s3{background:var(--plum-red);color:var(--fg-on-red)} .s4{background:var(--plum-red-press);color:var(--fg-on-red)}
.dist-legend,.cmp-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem 1.2rem;font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-2);margin:.5rem 0 1.4rem}
.li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;white-space:nowrap}
.sw{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px}
.sw.s0,.sw.s1{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 0.5px var(--plum-red)}
.quarters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin:0}
.quarters>div{border-top:1px solid var(--line-lavender);padding-top:.8rem}
.quarters .mid{border-top-color:var(--plum-red)}
.quarters dt{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-2);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.quarters dd{margin:0}
.quarters .unit{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted)}
.quarters .num{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;color:var(--fg-1)}
@media (max-width:640px){.quarters{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.2rem}.quarters>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;padding:.6rem 0}.quarters dd{text-align:right}}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.chip{font:inherit;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-1);background:var(--cream);border:0.5px solid var(--plum-red);border-radius:0;min-height:44px;padding:.4rem .95rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s ease-out,color .2s ease-out}
.chip:hover{background:var(--sev-blush)}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--plum-red);color:var(--fg-on-red)}
.peer h3{margin:0 0 1rem}
.peer-insight{margin:1.3rem 0 .2rem!important;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,22px)!important;line-height:1.45!important}
.cmp-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:12rem 1fr;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:.85rem 0;border-top:0.5px solid var(--plum-red)}
.cmp-label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:17px;line-height:1.3}
.cmp-bars{display:grid;gap:.35rem;padding-right:3rem}
.cmp-bar{position:relative;height:14px;min-width:3px}
.cmp-bar.top,.sw.top{background:var(--plum-red)} .cmp-bar.rest,.sw.rest{background:var(--line-lavender)}
.cmp-bar span{position:absolute;left:calc(100% + .5rem);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg-1)}
@media (max-width:640px){.cmp-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.5rem}}

/* ── ADDITIONS FOR THIS PAGE (built on the same tokens) ── */
:root{--line-lavender:var(--line-lav);--line-lavender-2:var(--line-lav-2);--panel:var(--cream);--line:var(--line-lav);--ink-soft:var(--fg-2);--heading:var(--fg-1);--red:var(--plum-red);
  --b0:var(--sev-blush);--b1:var(--sev-pink);--b2:var(--sev-coral);--b3:var(--plum-red);--b4:var(--plum-red-press);--bar-base:var(--line-lav);--vision:var(--fg-1)}
html{scroll-padding-top:64px}
a{color:var(--plum-red)} a:hover{color:var(--plum-red-deep)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--plum-red);outline-offset:3px}
.masthead-meta a{color:var(--fg-on-red)}
.rule-section.lav .rule-line{background:var(--line-lav)} .rule-section.lav .rule-arr-l{border-right-color:var(--line-lav)} .rule-section.lav .rule-arr-r{border-left-color:var(--line-lav)}
.rule-section.lav{margin-top:48px}
.toc-bar{position:sticky}
.toc-bar a.active{color:var(--fg-1)!important;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--plum-red)!important}
.toc-progress{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-1px;height:1.5px;width:0;background:var(--plum-red);transition:width .15s ease-out;pointer-events:none}
.toc-bar{overflow:visible} .toc-bar ul{overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none} .toc-bar ul::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
/* overview */
.author-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px 24px;align-items:center;padding:14px 0;border-top:0.5px solid var(--line-lav);border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--line-lav);margin:0 0 28px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--fg-muted)}
.author-strip strong{color:var(--fg-1);font-weight:600}
.share{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 16px;align-items:center}
.share span{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.share a{text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.answer-p{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--fg-2);max-width:680px;margin-bottom:14px}
.answer-p:first-of-type{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(19px,2.2vw,23px);line-height:1.5;color:var(--fg-1);letter-spacing:-.01em}
/* chapter heads */
.chapter-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:clamp(16px,3vw,36px);padding-top:40px;align-items:start}
.ch-num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(56px,8vw,96px);line-height:.9;color:var(--plum-red);letter-spacing:-.04em}
.ch-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.05;color:var(--fg-1);margin:2px 0 10px}
.ch-desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--fg-2);max-width:560px;margin-bottom:16px}
.ch-links{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.ch-links a{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-2);background:var(--cream-deep);border:0.5px solid var(--line-lav);padding:5px 10px;transition:color .15s,border-color .15s}
.ch-links a:hover{color:var(--plum-red);border-color:var(--plum-red)}
@media (max-width:640px){.chapter-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}}
/* sections */
.sec{padding-top:40px}
.sec>h2{max-width:720px}
.sec>.section-intro{color:var(--fg-1);font-size:17px}
.sec>.section-intro strong{font-weight:600}
.sec p{max-width:680px}
.sec>p:not(.section-intro):not(.start){font-size:16px;color:var(--fg-2);margin-bottom:14px}
.start{font-size:15px;color:var(--fg-2);background:var(--cream-deep);border-left:2px solid var(--plum-red);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0;margin:20px 0 0;max-width:none!important}
.start strong{color:var(--fg-1);font-weight:600}
.sec h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--fg-1);margin:22px 0 8px;line-height:1.3}
.deep-acc-body h3:first-child{margin-top:0}
.deep-acc-body ul,.deep-acc-body ol:not(.steps){padding-left:18px;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:680px}
.deep-acc-body li{font-size:15px;color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.7;margin:4px 0}
.deep-acc-body li::marker{color:var(--plum-red)}
.deep-accordion{margin-top:24px}
.deep-accordion details:not([open])>summary .acc-summary-sub{color:var(--fg-muted)}
.faq-acc .acc-summary-title{font-size:clamp(16px,1.9vw,19px);margin:0!important}
.faq-acc summary{padding:16px 22px}
.callout p{margin:0}
/* tables */
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;border:1px solid var(--line-lav);border-radius:var(--r-card);margin:20px 0;background:var(--cream)}
.table-wrap table{width:100%;min-width:560px;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:14px}
.table-wrap thead th{background:var(--fg-1);color:rgba(255,250,242,.72);padding:10px 13px;text-align:left;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:bottom}
.table-wrap td{padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2);color:var(--fg-1);vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6}
.table-wrap tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.table-wrap tbody tr:nth-child(even) td{background:var(--cream-deep)}
.table-wrap td:first-child{font-weight:600}
.table-wrap caption.src{caption-side:bottom;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-muted);padding:10px 14px;border-top:0.5px solid var(--line-lav-2)}
details.as-table>summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--plum-red);margin:12px 0 0;list-style:none}
details.as-table>summary::before{content:"+ "}
details.as-table[open]>summary::before{content:"– "}
/* data components restyled */
.dist-card,.peer-card,.cmp-card{background:var(--cream)!important;border:1px solid var(--line-lav);border-radius:var(--r-card)!important;padding:22px 24px!important;margin:24px 0!important}
.dist-card figcaption,.cmp-card figcaption{font-size:11.5px!important;font-weight:600!important;letter-spacing:.08em!important}
.quarters>div{border-top-color:var(--line-lav-2)!important}
.quarters .mid{border-top-color:var(--plum-red)!important}
.quarters .num{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,32px)!important}
.peer h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 14px}
.peer-insight{font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,22px)!important;line-height:1.45!important;color:var(--fg-1);border-left:2px solid var(--plum-red);padding:10px 16px;background:var(--cream-deep);border-radius:0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0;margin:18px 0 0!important;max-width:none!important}
.chip{border-radius:0!important;font-size:11px!important;font-weight:600!important;min-height:38px!important}
.cmp-label{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:17px}
/* steps */
.steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:24px 0;counter-reset:s;border:1px solid var(--line-lav);border-radius:var(--r-card);overflow:hidden;display:grid;gap:1px;background:var(--line-lav)}
.step{counter-increment:s;background:var(--cream);padding:18px 20px 16px 64px;position:relative}
.step::before{content:counter(s,decimal-leading-zero);position:absolute;left:20px;top:16px;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:26px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--plum-red)}
.step h3{margin:0 0 6px!important}
.step p{font-size:15px;color:var(--fg-2);margin:0}
/* stats + report */
.stat-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr))}
.stat-box .stat-unit{display:block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--plum-red);margin-bottom:6px}
p.src{font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-muted);margin:8px 0 0}
.report-card{display:block;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line-lav);border-radius:var(--r-card);padding:20px 22px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg-1);margin-top:20px;transition:box-shadow .2s}
.report-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);color:var(--fg-1)}
.report-card .badge{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px}
.rc-title{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:6px}
.rc-desc{display:block;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px}
.rc-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--plum-red)}
/* CTA */
.outside-lane.cta{margin-top:64px;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,40px)}
.outside-lane.cta .section-label{color:var(--sev-coral)}
.outside-lane.cta h2{color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:14px}
.outside-lane.cta p{font-size:15.5px;color:rgba(255,250,242,.72);line-height:1.7;max-width:620px;margin-bottom:12px}
.outside-lane.cta a:not(.nav-cta){color:var(--cream)}
.outside-lane.cta .nav-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:12px 24px;font-size:15px}
/* deck controls */
.deck-ctl{position:fixed;z-index:90;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .2s ease-out,visibility .2s}
.deck-ctl.on{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.deck-ctl button{font:inherit;width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum-red);border:1px solid var(--plum-red);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}
.deck-ctl button:hover{background:var(--plum-red);color:var(--fg-on-red)}
.deck-ctl button:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:default;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum-red)}
.deck-ctl svg{width:16px;height:16px}
.ctl-text{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted);min-width:0}
.ctl-count{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--plum-red);margin-right:6px;font-weight:400}
@media (min-width:641px){.deck-ctl{right:clamp(16px,3vw,36px);bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 24px);flex-direction:column}.ctl-name{display:none}}
@media (max-width:640px){
 .deck-ctl{left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:8px 16px calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 8px);background:var(--cream);border-top:1px solid var(--line-lav);justify-content:space-between}
 .deck-ctl button{width:44px;height:44px}
 .ctl-text{flex:1;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
 body{padding-bottom:calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) + 64px)}
}
@media (max-width:640px){.intro-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.calc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line-lav);border:1px solid var(--line-lav);border-radius:var(--r-card);margin:24px 0;overflow:visible}
.calc-in,.calc-out{background:var(--cream);padding:22px 22px 24px}
.calc-in{border-radius:var(--r-card) 0 0 var(--r-card)}
.calc-out{background:var(--cream-deep);border-radius:0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0;align-self:stretch}
.calc-out>*{max-width:none}
@media (min-width:861px){.calc-out{position:sticky;top:64px;align-self:start;border-radius:0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0}}
@media (max-width:860px){.calc{grid-template-columns:1fr}.calc-in{border-radius:var(--r-card) var(--r-card) 0 0}.calc-out{border-radius:0 0 var(--r-card) var(--r-card)}}
.calc fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 18px}
.calc fieldset:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.calc legend{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted);margin-bottom:8px;padding:0}
.opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.opt{position:relative;cursor:pointer}
.opt input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:1px;height:1px}
.opt span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:38px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--fg-1);background:var(--cream);border:0.5px solid var(--line-lav);transition:background .15s,color .15s,border-color .15s;line-height:1.25}
.opt:hover span{border-color:var(--plum-red)}
.opt input:checked+span{background:var(--plum-red);border-color:var(--plum-red);color:var(--fg-on-red)}
.opt input:focus-visible+span{outline:2px solid var(--plum-red);outline-offset:2px}
.chk span::before{content:"+";font-weight:400;margin-right:6px;color:var(--plum-red);font-size:15px;line-height:1}
.chk input:checked+span::before{content:"✓";color:var(--fg-on-red);font-size:12px}
.co-label,.co-k{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted)}
.co-big{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,54px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;color:var(--fg-1);margin:8px 0 6px}
.co-sub{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--fg-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px}
.pbar{position:relative;height:10px;background:var(--line-lav-2);margin:4px 0 6px}
.pbar-fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:50%;background:var(--plum-red);transition:width .25s ease-out}
.pbar-mark{position:absolute;top:-5px;width:2px;height:20px;background:var(--fg-1);left:50%;transform:translateX(-1px);transition:left .25s ease-out}
.tick{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:var(--cream-deep)}
.pbar-scale{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;color:var(--fg-muted);margin-bottom:18px}
.co-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--line-lav);border:1px solid var(--line-lav);margin-bottom:16px}
.co-split>div{background:var(--cream);padding:10px 12px}
.co-v{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:4px;color:var(--fg-1)}
.quad{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.6/1;border:1px solid var(--line-lav);background:var(--cream);margin:0 0 8px 18px}
.q-x{position:absolute;left:35%;top:0;bottom:0;border-left:1px dashed var(--line-lav)}
.q-y{position:absolute;top:45%;left:0;right:0;border-top:1px dashed var(--line-lav)}
.q-lbl{position:absolute;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-muted)}
