    <h1>The <em>cost</em> of group health insurance for companies in India</h1>
    <p class="masthead-sub">A pricing guide for founders, HR leaders, and finance teams buying group health insurance (GHI) in 2026. Every number on this page is an indicative range, not a quote. The ranges reflect what the Indian GHI market typically produces for different company profiles, and the drivers that move a specific company toward the low or high end sit next to every range. Benchmarks from Plum's own customer data, FY22 to FY26.</p>
