r spenders</span><div class="stat-num">9 in 10</div><div class="stat-label">Cover parents, carry ₹7.5 lakh or more, or both.</div></div></div><p class="src">Source: Plum customer data, FY22 to FY26.</p><a class="report-card" href="https://www.plumhq.com/standard-of-employee-benefits">
